70.8661417322834666 545.1025984251967884 Td
(StrictMode deliberately runs additional effect setup and cleanup cycles in development to expose effects that are not) Tj
T* (reversible. If registration leaves a stale global function, a second setup can overwrite it and later cleanup can delete the) Tj
T* (wrong one. A cleanup function with an identity check makes setup and teardown safe to repeat.) Tj
